            <note corresp="#d283-f2" n="2" xml:id="d283-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 3570 from Geneva, May 15, contains the complete text of the West’s
                    “global initiative for human contacts and information,” presented to the Eastern
                    delegations to CSCE the same day. (National
                    Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign Policy
                    Files)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
